{"kp_id": "zj-016.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-016", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "久咳属虚、久病为虚，可于太渊下针。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lu9", "disease.ke_sou"], "chapter_id": "zj-016.c01", "evidence_quote": "久咳，都是虚症，久病为虚好，都可以在太原上面下针", "seg_from": 5, "seg_to": 5, "start_s": 20.19, "end_s": 28.93, "citation": {"youtube_id": "Bm4C22zxyD4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bm4C22zxyD4&t=20s", "series": "zj", "episode": 16, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 16", "start_s": 20.19, "end_s": 28.93}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "太原=太渊", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-016.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-016", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "鱼际为肺经荥穴，属火。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lu10"], "chapter_id": "zj-016.c01", "evidence_quote": "就是我们的溶穴，然后属火哦", "seg_from": 13, "seg_to": 13, "start_s": 86.56, "end_s": 96.57, "citation": {"youtube_id": "Bm4C22zxyD4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bm4C22zxyD4&t=86s", "series": "zj", "episode": 16, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 16", "start_s": 86.56, "end_s": 96.57}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "渔具/鱼鲫=鱼际；溶穴=荥穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-016.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-016", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "少商为肺经井穴，常点刺挤血数滴；属十三鬼穴；治小儿扁桃体炎可迅解局部胀痛。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lu11", "new.method.点刺放血", "new.concept.十三鬼穴", "new.disease.扁桃腺炎"], "chapter_id": "zj-016.c01", "evidence_quote": "平常呢我们是点刺放血", "seg_from": 16, "seg_to": 31, "start_s": 115.02, "end_s": 208.395, "citation": {"youtube_id": "Bm4C22zxyD4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bm4C22zxyD4&t=115s", "series": "zj", "episode": 16, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 16", "start_s": 115.02, "end_s": 208.4}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "邵商/少桑/芍伤=少商", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-016.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-016", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "扁桃放血后配列缺，咽痛可缓；再点刺少商为常用手法。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lu7", "acupoint.lu11"], "chapter_id": "zj-016.c01", "evidence_quote": "你可以下列缺到海喉，喉咙就不痛了", "seg_from": 71, "seg_to": 71, "start_s": 423.52, "end_s": 431.475, "citation": {"youtube_id": "Bm4C22zxyD4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bm4C22zxyD4&t=423s", "series": "zj", "episode": 16, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 16", "start_s": 423.52, "end_s": 431.48}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "到海喉=利咽喉", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-016.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-016", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "时证发作时，据《针灸甲乙经》可针其腧——太渊。", "entity_ids": ["classic.zhen_jiu_jia_yi_jing", "acupoint.lu9", "concept.shu_xue"], "chapter_id": "zj-016.c01", "evidence_quote": "按照针灸甲乙经是不是针它的腧穴就太渊穴", "seg_from": 81, "seg_to": 81, "start_s": 473.56, "end_s": 484.45, "citation": {"youtube_id": "Bm4C22zxyD4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bm4C22zxyD4&t=473s", "series": "zj", "episode": 16, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 16", "start_s": 473.56, "end_s": 484.45}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "执证=时证", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-016.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-016", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "大肠者传导之官，变化出焉；流注约上午五点至七点。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.da_chang", "meridian.li", "concept.zi_wu_liu_zhu"], "chapter_id": "zj-016.c02", "evidence_quote": "大肠者传导之官，变化出焉", "seg_from": 99, "seg_to": 107, "start_s": 570.69, "end_s": 622.305, "citation": {"youtube_id": "Bm4C22zxyD4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bm4C22zxyD4&t=570s", "series": "zj", "episode": 16, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 16", "start_s": 570.69, "end_s": 622.3}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
